  "title": "authID Announces its 2026 Annual Meeting to be Held on July 6, 2026",
  "summary": "DENVER, June 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- authID® (Nasdaq: AUID)(“authID” or the “Company”), a leading provider of biometric identity verification and authentication solutions, today announces that the 2026 Annual Meeting will be held virtually on July 6, 2026, at 10.00 a.m.",
